+Request Product rate evidence uses uniquely attributable OriginalData from one
+exact output and sender direction. Acquisition or expiry establishes a fixed
+assignment-time floor; later ACKs do not advance that floor. After the first
+valid covered cohort, each chronological cohort uses the slower of its paired
+ACK-endpoint and latest-assignment-endpoint intervals. Its earliest assignment
+MUST be at or after the previous valid cohort's latest assignment, not its ACK.
+Old or interleaved cohorts produce no numeric evidence, do not move the valid
+anchors, and contribute no bytes to a later sample. Their exact Data ACK
+release and volume qualification remain independent. This observation measures
+achieved Product receipt service, not native capacity or ordered application
+goodput. It changes no coverage, maturation, frozen-expiry, or Product resource
+requirement; an expired numeric epoch cannot be blended into its successor.
+
 ### 10.3 No second congestion controller
 
 RTT, loss, ECN, jitter, queue, flight, pacing, and delivery observations MAY
